    "title": "Pack The Cans",
    "description": "Welcome to Pack The Cans! This game is easy to get started, but it will make you want to stop! \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\nIn this colorful cannery, your task is to pack the same colored cans over and over again! Easy, huh? But don't be careless, it's a race of speed and skill! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f \ud83d\udca8\r\n\r\nKeep your eyes on the screen and your fingers on the fly! When the cans of the same color roll in, click on them and put them into the mission's packing box! But be careful, the factory does not give you unlimited space, the spare grid is limited! Use your limited grid wisely to make every packing more efficient! \ud83e\udde0 \u2728",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Pack The Cans! This game is easy to get started, but it will make you want to stop! \ud83c\udf89<br><br>In this colorful cannery, your task is to pack the same colored cans over and over again! Easy, huh? But don&#39;t be careless, it&#39;s a race of speed and skill! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f \ud83d\udca8<br><br>Keep your eyes on the screen and your fingers on the fly! When the cans of the same color roll in, click on them and put them into the mission&#39;s packing box! But be careful, the factory does not give you unlimited space, the spare grid is limited! Use your limited grid wisely to make every packing more efficient! \ud83e\udde0 \u2728",
